<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24921" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διακελ-εύομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>exhort, give orders, direct,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τινὶ εἶναι, ποιεῖν,</span> etc.,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				25.28
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ τοῦτό σοι
			διεκελευόμην,</span> c. inf., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Euthphr.</u>
				6d
			</span></i>; so 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ὅπως . .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>R.</u>
					549e
				</span></i>
			; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τινί τι</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιεῖν</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				218a
			</span></i>, etc.: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				148e
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>encourage one another,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.77
			</span></i>; freq. with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλήλοις</span>
			added, <i>cheer</i> one another <i>on,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				4.8.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἑαυτῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					1.4.13
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τοῖς θέουσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phd.</u>
					61a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>admonish, inform,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὶ περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					9.78
				</span></i>
			.—The 
				Act.
			 only in <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
